surrounds the area has numerous memorials commemorating the Hungarian drama and film industry."],["Zwack Unicum Museum & Visitor Centre","sight",47.47588,19.06962,"IX. Soroksári út 26, entry from Dandár utca","Museum: Mon-Sat 10:00-17:00, Shop: Mon-Fri 09:00-18:00, Sat 10:00-18:00","","","","r","English guided tours are available for groups! Group registration: +36 1 4762383. - Shop: Dandár utca 1. Visitors can watch a film about the Zwack family’s and the Zwack company’s history (circa 20 min). There is the biggest mini bottle…"],["Palace of Arts","activity",47.46961,19.07178,"Komor Marcell utca 1.","09:00-18:00","","","","r","This modern, power plant-looking building hides an excellent modern art museum (Ludwig Múzeum), a festival theatre (Fesztivál Színház) and the marvellous Béla Bartók National Concert Hall (Bartók Béla Nemzeti Hangversenyterem), which…"],["Budapest Park Club","bar",47.46756,19.07762,"IX. Fábián Juli tér 1.","Mon Tue Sat Sun: Program-Specific, Thu Fri Sat: 17:00-05:00, Ticket office: Mon-Sat 17:00-20:00","","","","r","Europe's largest, open throughout the summer, open-air club. Concerts."]]}